#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/deployment/pd_disaggregation.rst:3
msgid "Prefill–Decode disaggregation"
msgstr "PD 分离部署"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/deployment/pd_disaggregation.rst:5
msgid ""
"Separate prompt processing from token generation so long prefill work does not "
"repeatedly interrupt decode batches. Xavier transfers the KV cache between replicas "
"and maintains a shared per-model block tracker for cross-replica prefix reuse."
msgstr ""
"将提示词处理与 token 生成分开，避免耗时的 prefill 反复打断 decode 批次。Xavier 在副本间传输 KV 缓存，并维护每个模型共享的 block "
"tracker，以跨副本复用前缀。"

