#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/deployment/pd_disaggregation.rst:26
msgid ""
"Qwen3 was validated. The record also lists Qwen2.5, Llama-3.1, GLM-4, QwQ and "
"DeepSeek-R1-Distill as applicable model families; they were not all individually "
"validated in this record."
msgstr "已验证 Qwen3。记录还列出 Qwen2.5、Llama-3.1、GLM-4、QwQ 和 DeepSeek-R1-Distill 等适用模型系列，但并未逐一验证。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/deployment/pd_disaggregation.rst:27
msgid "Hybrid linear-attention / SSM models"
msgstr "混合线性注意力 / SSM 模型"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/deployment/pd_disaggregation.rst:28
msgid ""
"Qwen3.5 and Qwen3.6 produced garbled output in this configuration. Do not use them "
"with this recorded Xavier V1 setup."
msgstr "在此配置下，Qwen3.5 和 Qwen3.6 输出乱码。不要在记录中的 Xavier V1 配置上使用它们。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/deployment/pd_disaggregation.rst:30
msgid ""
"Check the model configuration for ``linear_attention`` entries in ``layer_types`` or "
"a ``full_attention_interval`` field. The recorded Xavier path moves token-block KV "
"data; hybrid models also have recurrent state that needs different handling."
msgstr ""
"检查模型配置的  ``layer_types``  中是否包含  ``linear_attention`` ，或是否存在  "
"``full_attention_interval``  字段。记录中的 Xavier 路径传输 token block 的 KV "
"数据，混合架构还包含需要另行处理的循环状态。"

