#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/deployment/pd_disaggregation.rst:70
msgid ""
"Keep Prefill and Decode on separate GPUs. The recorded shared-GPU environment used "
"``gpu_memory_utilization=0.8`` to leave room for other containers; choose the value "
"from available memory rather than treating it as a universal default. The Xavier V1 "
"path in this record enables ``enforce_eager=True`` automatically."
msgstr ""
"Prefill 和 Decode 应使用不同 GPU。记录中的共享 GPU 环境使用  ``gpu_memory_utilization=0.8``  "
"为其他容器保留空间；请按可用显存选择数值，而非将其视为通用默认值。该记录中的 Xavier V1 路径会自动启用  ``enforce_eager=True`` 。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/deployment/pd_disaggregation.rst:73
msgid "Validate inference and transfers"
msgstr "验证推理与传输"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/deployment/pd_disaggregation.rst:75
msgid ""
"Confirm both roles are running, then use greedy decoding to inspect coherent output. "
"A successful HTTP response alone does not establish that KV transfer is correct."
msgstr "确认两个角色均已运行，再使用贪心解码检查输出是否连贯。仅 HTTP 请求成功不能证明 KV 传输正确。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/deployment/pd_disaggregation.rst:77
msgid "Greedy decoding check"
msgstr "贪心解码检查"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/deployment/pd_disaggregation.rst:91
msgid ""
"Inspect logs for Xavier block staging, sending and receiving, and for the remote "
"decode/prefill flags. Repeated newlines or garbled text in the recorded hybrid-model "
"setup indicate invalid transferred state; sampling can obscure the symptom."
msgstr ""
"检查 Xavier block 暂存、发送、接收以及远程 decode/prefill "
"标志。记录中的混合模型配置出现重复换行或乱码，说明传输状态异常；采样可能掩盖这一现象。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/deployment/pd_disaggregation.rst:93
msgid "Transfer indicators from the validation record"
msgstr "验证记录中的传输标志"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
