msgid "Known limitations"
msgstr "已知限制"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/deployment/pd_disaggregation.rst:103
msgid ""
"The original record mentions fixes for non-streaming responses, BF16 transfer "
"precision and stale block registrations. It does not identify their released image "
"version. Confirm the deployed version contains those fixes before relying on the "
"corresponding behavior."
msgstr "原始记录提到非流式响应、BF16 传输精度及过期 block 注册的修复，但未注明修复发布于哪个镜像版本。依赖相应行为前，请确认部署版本包含这些修复。"

